{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53188","headline":"诗偈 十三 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人有五般花，花兰（一本云「花烂」）变成香。\n氤氲满故宅，供养本爷娘。\n有人见不识，报道十月桑。\n外尘一念爱，合成五色囊。\n囊中起三柱，柱上有千梁。\n梁变成地狱，地狱作天堂。\n缘个一羣贼，自作自消亡。\n纵令存草命，何时还故乡？\n文字说定慧，定慧是爷娘。\n何不依理智，逐色在他乡。\n早须归大宅，孝顺见爷娘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53188.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53188","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}